	"Description": "Registers the UE5AutomationExtras toolset with the editor's MCP toolset registry. Brings ue5-automation v3.0 verification-grade capabilities into the official Unreal MCP: PIE state reads, log self-service, actor find/teleport with read-back verification, and (with the BlueprintPythonBridge C++ plugin deployed) node-level graph read/connect that fixes the DSL's missing exec wires.",
